msgctxt "Nova demo"
msgid "Enter counts, intervals or comparisons. Round brackets exclude an endpoint and square brackets include it. Use ∞, inf or infinity with - or − on the left and an optional + on the right. ASCII letters are case-insensitive, as in (−INFINITY,3] or [3,Inf). Use round brackets on unbounded sides, including blank or * endpoints. A standalone * matches every count. Numeric endpoints must be ordered and lie between zero and the number of selected tags."
msgstr "可填写命中数、区间或单边比较。圆括号不含端点，方括号包含端点。无穷端点可写 ∞、inf 或 infinity，左端可用半角负号 - 或数学负号 −，右端可省略加号。英文字母不区分大小写，例如 (−INFINITY,3] 或 [3,Inf)。无界的一侧用圆括号，也可留空或填写 *。单独的 * 匹配任意命中数，包括零。数值端点须在 0 到已选标签数之间，下限不能大于上限。"

